 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "tiny-witch-188725@1.1.4",
   "gameId": "tiny-witch-188725",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.4",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-29T01:02:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello magical beings! 🪄",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Ramon from Creative Hand here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I decided to write this update myself, because it brings a fix I owed many of you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🏆 All Decorated Achievement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]I got several reports that the All Decorated achievement wasn't unlocking on Normal difficulty. I dug into it, opened the saves you sent me, and found the problem.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]The achievement was counting every decoration in the game, including 8 that are only sold in Casual mode. On Normal, the shop has 15 decorations, so it could never be completed no matter how much you bought. The mistake was mine, not yours. Your saves were fine all along.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Now the achievement only counts the decorations your difficulty actually sells. If you already bought all 15 on Normal, it unlocks as soon as you enter a store, with no need to buy anything again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]A heartfelt thank you to everyone who reported this and sent me their saves. 💜",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎨 New Tiny Witch Avatars",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Tiny Witch now has 6 profile avatars on Steam for everyone who owns the game! Now you can show off the little witch and her cat on your profile, drawn with the same care as the game. 🧙‍♀️🐱",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41277622/4a8a7ae4c0024c4e6fa14d50e4a1a4ac35272ca6.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "[p align=\"start\"]How to use them",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Open your Steam profile and click Edit Profile.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Go to Avatar.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the avatars from your games, click See All and find Tiny Witch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pick your favorite and click Save.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "✨ Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Controller vibration",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]I added controller vibration: your gamepad now vibrates when you take damage, get hit by mushroom spores, and when you win or lose a day.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "👾 Bugfixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]I also took the chance to fix other things that you and I found along the way:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievement progress no longer carries over from one level to the next by mistake.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Saves",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Restarting a completed store no longer resets your progress in the other stores.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your save is no longer overwritten if it fails to load.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed progress from one save slot leaking into another after returning to the title screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the world map not loading correctly when choosing Continue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Daily hazards now refresh properly when loading a saved game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tutorial",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a tutorial step that could get stuck because the level briefing didn't open.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Day 5 decoration check now counts every Casual mode decoration.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Audio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The victory music no longer overlaps or loops incorrectly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Interface",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed shop scrolling.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed crashes in the pause menu and the Options menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash when closing the book.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]If you run into any other issues, let me know using this form. I read every single one.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Thanks for playing! 💫",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ramon Creative Hand 🧙‍♀️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
