  {
   "id": "tiny-witch-188725@1.1.0",
   "gameId": "tiny-witch-188725",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-01-20T13:36:46.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello magical beings, We are releasing the new version of Tiny Witch with great appreciation and pride.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👑 Major Feature",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Casual Mode: A brand-new mode for players seeking a more relaxing and fun experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚒️ Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The tutorial has been updated with new images and clearer explanations about decorations, the Casual Mode, and other features.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The \"Restart Level\" option was renamed to \"Restart Day\" for better clarity.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Game commands now respond more smoothly, making gameplay feel more fluid.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Texts across the game were adjusted to enhance localization, and the following languages were added:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Simplified Chinese (SCH)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Russian",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spanish (EU)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "German",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Japanese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "French",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Polish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Turkish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Interface improvements:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tutorial messages and GIFs have been refined for easier understanding.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Text alignment and spacing issues across various screens (e.g., shop, recipe book, world map) have been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Menus such as \"Attention\" and \"Resource Shortage\" have been centralized for better readability.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Visual elements like titles and icons have been polished to ensure a cleaner experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fonts were adjusted to better support Japanese and Chinese text, avoiding clipping or overlapping issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Decorations now affect the entire shop instead of just adjacent customers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new visual feedback system shows buffs and debuffs on the little witch, including how long they last.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Critters: New small creatures have been added to liven up the phases.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a direction indicator to show which way the little witch is facing, improving navigation and gameplay clarity.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "👾 Bugfixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the sound of drips from leaks would persist indefinitely.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved a crash occurring during the night session of the shop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now restart any challenge shop and return to Day 01, even if not all days have been completed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a problem that caused the game to close when accessing credits in certain languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue where the catalyst would disappear from the cauldron when exiting to the main menu without refunding the gold. The cauldron's state is now saved and restored properly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other minor bugs were fixed to enhance overall stability and gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Best Regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Creative Hand team",
