  {
   "id": "tiny-witch-188725@1.0.1",
   "gameId": "tiny-witch-188725",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.0.1",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-09T17:38:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello magical beings! 🔮",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚒️ Improvement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've improved the brightness of the items when positioning them in the store to make them stand out more.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now the castalizer lasts the whole working day instead of half the day.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now use the arrows in the menus.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The collision box of several attacks has been reduced",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now, when he's in the quicksand, he's no longer hit by any attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved so that all cuts are skipped with a cancel button",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've improved the map transition smoothly;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👾 Bugfix",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We adjusted some words that were misspelled.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The item in the chest is no longer deleted when you reset the store because you don't have the necessary materials;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed so that the witches' confusion attack no longer hits in the air.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the bug where the goteria sound was playing non-stop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed items and dirt remaining in the store during the preparation stage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the book sound that kept playing even when you weren't turning pages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's it for now folks, keep following us for more news.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Best Regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Creative Hand team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
